er is required could they be dominated or enthralled to teach the discipline?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27607-bloodyrelight","name":"BloodyRelight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27607_2.webp","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"52"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-12-04T00:47:34-08:00","id":1526312,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BloodyRelight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1502801-ask-a-simple-question-vampire?p=1526302#post1526302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So kindred can learn clan specific disciplines by drinking another kindred of that clans blood does this require consent or is the knowledge purely in the vitae? For instance if you best another vampire in combat and drink but not to the point of draining would you be able to gain that clan specific discipline?<br /> <br /> The book says two things in one section it says you need blood and a teacher but on page 125 it says the vampire must simply track another down and take a point of their blood. If the teacher is required could they be dominated or enthralled to teach the discipline?</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually the text, in the Learning new discipline section, mention you only need to track down another vampire (not of that specific clan) who possesses that unique discipline, drinking at least a point of vitae. I'm personally s